OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer's new exhibition
OL,4,Ainspired by pubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA renowned Bradford photographer has
OL,7,Fopened his latest exhibition, which he
OL,8,Fsaid is all about the health benefits
OL,9,Fof walking to the pub.
OL,11,FTake a Walk on the Mild Side features
OL,12,Fimages Ian Beesley has taken across the
OL,13,Findustrial north on both sides of the
OL,14,FPennines.
OL,16,FThey have gone on display at Salts Mill
OL,17,Fin Saltaire and he has also made an
OL,18,Faccompanying booklet with Barnsley poet
OL,19,FIan McMillan.
